Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Y
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.99,0:01:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I've seized your precious Egyptian\NGod card, your defeat is guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.87,0:01:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One more turn and you will\Nvanish into the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.17,0:01:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,With your former self on my team,\Nthere's no way I can lose. Now proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.49,0:01:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,With pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.69,0:01:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how does it\Nfeel to know I'm holding
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.81,0:01:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,your most powerful card the winged dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.99,0:01:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,of raw for after it\Nstrikes i'll win and you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.41,0:01:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,will be consumed by the\Nrealm of darkness and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.49,0:01:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,i shall reclaim the body\Nthat you have stolen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.31,0:01:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,from me you have it wrong you should be on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.53,0:01:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,your knees thanking me Or you would never
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.35,0:01:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Be where you are today.\NHad it not been for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.25,0:01:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:58.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've forgotten\Nthat when you were a child It was I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.19,0:02:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,who took over your body And forced\Nyou to claim the Millennium Rod
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, this relic is mine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Since that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.23,0:02:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The rod's been yours. While I stayed\Nhidden deep within your soul, Maric.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.75,0:02:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that I'm in control\Nagain, the Rod's power is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.95,0:02:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Until the winged dragon\Nof Rod destroys you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Merrick, but your\Nranting has become tiresome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This shadow game will determine\Nwho stays and who fades away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So allow me to continue by playing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic card, Vengeful Bog Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.59,0:02:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This card forces all monsters to\Nwait one turn before attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.59,0:02:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So even if you can summon\NRa, you can't use it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon it will be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this desperate move will\Nonly delay your inevitable destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.43,0:02:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.99,0:02:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You must summon the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.75,0:02:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.55,0:03:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, where exactly was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.41,0:03:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe as I sacrifice my three\Nmonsters to summon this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.91,0:03:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winged Dragon of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.29,0:03:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.67,0:03:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,My Draft Card is about to\Nrender your dragon useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.79,0:03:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you send those three\Nmonsters to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.03,0:03:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Joyful Doom will strip\Nthem of their attack
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.05,0:03:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,points and add the\Ntotal to my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So that means your monsters will have zero
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.11,0:03:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,attack points when they\Ngo to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,as my power grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,This will make Ra\Ncompletely useless to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.71,0:03:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at your pathetic creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.27,0:03:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.41,0:04:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have summoned\Nthe winged dragon of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but thanks to my trap card,\Nhe has no power at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How can an Egyptian god monster\Nhave zero attack points?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the monsters you sacrificed\Nto summon Ra had zero attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.05,0:04:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Once his trap card stripped away\Ntheir power, Ra was left with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you warn me\Nthat this might happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't aware he was holding\Nthat trap card, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.21,0:04:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.12,0:04:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,now all the strength that\Nwould have transferred
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to Ra has been added to his life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.81,0:04:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I will switch Ra, my\Npuppet master, to defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.11,0:04:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha, you don't have much choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.11,0:04:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.51,0:04:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.35,0:04:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.83,0:05:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Bacora's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.79,0:05:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi! Wake up! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! Hello? Yugi! Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.85,0:05:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Teya! Open up! Teya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.41,0:05:19.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of late, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't this wait till morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just in Bakura's\Nroom, and he's missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.69,0:05:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.01,0:05:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel is done. Just make\Nyour move. If you insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.87,0:05:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tristan attack his puppet\Nmaster with spiral thrust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.19,0:05:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winged dragon of\NRa is next Then you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Disappear? Wrong. I'll turn\Nthis around with just one card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be referring to\Nyour Egyptian god card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you it's useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can't attack you\Nwith the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can send it to the graveyard to\Nsummon something stronger in its place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.29,0:06:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the Dark Ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.93,0:06:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you've given up on your\NEgyptian god card already. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.87,0:06:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll regret that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.61,0:06:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent the winged dragon\Nof Ra to the graveyard
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.51,0:06:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,because with zero attack\Npoints it was far too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, it's buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.11,0:06:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've discarded it so neither\Nof us can use its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For even if you do bring\NRa back from the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.31,0:06:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,it will have zero attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.27,0:06:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So if you'd like to fight me with\Na useless monster by your side,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and revive your Egyptian\Ngod card. While I proceed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:07:01.21,Default,,0,0,0,,with your destruction by\Nfeeding you to the shadows Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,that evil being must be\Ndestroyed so I can regain control
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.13,0:07:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,of my body Next I shall continue\Nmy onslaught by sacrificing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.75,0:07:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,three monsters from my graveyard\NTo bring forth one more
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.25,0:07:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Beast. Now allow me to\Nintroduce you to Dark Necrofear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A great beast of ultimate darkness\Nthat will show you no mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.11,0:07:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, go, Dark Necrophair!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.01,0:07:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I shall activate\Nmy magic burial card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.77,0:07:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,By giving up 800 of my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.73,0:07:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I can bring my Earl of Demise\Nback from the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.53,0:07:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Three monsters on my side of the field,\Nyou'll think twice about attacking me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.31,0:07:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to win, don't be so\Nreckless with our life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.85,0:07:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, our\Nlife points, you parasite?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the one fighting this duel, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:07:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wise up, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.67,0:08:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want the secret to the Pharaoh's\Npower, then you'll listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But you haven't helped me at all, Marek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.59,0:08:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you're the reason I wasn't\Nable to play the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.23,0:08:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, and it's your fault we\Nlost so many life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at those two. What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so sad when such good\Nfriends can't work things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.51,0:08:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your new monsters are impressive,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.57,0:08:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but let me remind you my\Nvengeful fog is still in effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,which means they can't attack just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware of your\Nmagic card's effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so go ahead and make your\Nmove while you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.19,0:08:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but I can barely see you over\Nthere, and soon you'll vanish completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.09,0:08:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've looked all over, but there's\Nno sign of Bacora anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Even on a blimp as big as this\None, he couldn't just disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.45,0:08:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet Merrick's behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.27,0:08:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's see what\Nwould happen if my crush
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:09:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,card combination took on\Nthe winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.21,0:09:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, only a 13 % chance of victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra has even more power than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you laughing at?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.01,0:09:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,How I'll destroy you with the\NEgyptian god card you threw away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.09,0:09:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're bluffing. Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.37,0:09:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is it possible the winged\Ndragon Avrah may possess
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,a few special abilities\Nthat you're not aware of?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought I knew\Nall Avrah's abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,what's this instant attack according to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,my card database the winged dragon of ra
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.41,0:09:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,has a special secret power i must add it\Nto my deck i already possess the mighty
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:10:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,obelisk the tormentor and winning slifer\Nwill be simple but rise in a class by
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,itself the egyptian god cards have proven
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.03,0:10:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to be the most powerful\Ncards in all of duel
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsters, most trap cards are useless\Nagainst all three of them and magic cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,only last for one turn but the winged
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.91,0:10:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,dragon of ra seems to\Npossess several special
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,abilities that aren't even written on\Nthe card so even if a duelist is able to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,decipher the card's ancient text they still\Nwon't know how to use all of its powers
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If I use Monster Reborn to bring back the\NWicked Dragon of Ra, it will only remain
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.41,0:10:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,on the field for a short time that's because\Nmagic cards only last for one turn when
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.31,0:10:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,used on an egyptian god card and since my\Nvengeful fog magic card is still in effect
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,All monsters must wait one turn to attack\Nwhen they are summoned, and by then Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.19,0:11:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,would be back in the graveyard but not\Nif i use its power of instant attack this
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.89,0:11:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow game's about to end once i summon\Nthe mighty winged dragon of ra nothing you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,can do can hold it back so that's what it
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.61,0:11:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,means if the winged dragon of rise brought
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,back from the graveyard it can attack right\Naway using its power of instant attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Estrado's dueling arena is the\Nonly place we haven't checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.71,0:11:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, look at all that fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.95,0:11:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,a shadow duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.17,0:11:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura's in there, and he must be dueling
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.13,0:11:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,against Merrick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.04,0:11:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura's in a shadow game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.91,0:11:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If Bakura loses this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll be trapped in the\Nshadow realm this is dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.07,0:11:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tear and enough people have\Ngotten hurt already, so please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,go back downstairs i'm\Nsorry but there's no way i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.97,0:12:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,leaving you here alone we're\Nin this thing together you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,need to the end i was with\Nyou the day you found out
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.97,0:12:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,about your past and discovered\Nyour destiny but tear but
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.25,0:12:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,nothing i'm gonna help you\Nand that's final now you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,learn the secrets of my\NEgyptian God card the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.41,0:12:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare yourself, or once I\Nresurrect the winged dragon of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.15,0:12:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be engulfed in complete darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.73,0:12:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So I activate Monster Reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.39,0:12:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to bring back the card you took\Nfrom me, the winged dragon of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.51,0:12:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.45,0:12:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The monster's attack\Nstrength is still zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.35,0:13:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, his vengeful Bob\Ncard is still in play,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.67,0:13:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,which means he can't attack now anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.43,0:13:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.71,0:13:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, you don't know\Nall the secrets of Ra.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.01,0:13:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to witness instant\Nattack. Instant attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.49,0:13:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.55,0:13:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.29,0:13:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess the winged dragon of\NRa does have secret powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.65,0:13:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.56,0:13:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And once I unleash those powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.53,0:13:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll both be wandering\Nthe Shadow Realm for all
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.19,0:13:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,eternity while I rule the\Nentire world as Pharaoh. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.69,0:13:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ra is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.37,0:13:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's mine once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.97,0:13:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare to witness\Nits secret powers now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.15,0:13:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I shall use Ra's\Npower of instant attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.23,0:13:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.14,0:13:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It means Ra can attack right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.97,0:13:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not the winged dragon\Nof Ra's only secret power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.95,0:13:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also its point-to-point\Ntransfer ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What is point-to-point transfer?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:14:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is your body\Ndisappearing into the shadows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.57,0:14:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm giving my life points to Ra in\Norder to increase its attack strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.31,0:14:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep one life point\Nto make sure I don't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.85,0:14:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now watch as my Egyptian god core grows\Nstronger as I transfer my power to Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that I've given my strength\Nto the winged dragon of Ra,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.61,0:14:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,we have learned together to\Nbecome one mighty creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.59,0:14:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And together we shall destroy you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.59,0:14:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,while the rest of my body waits\Non the border of the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.27,0:14:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, but it can!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.83,0:14:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Winged Dragon of Ra, let us attack now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.73,0:14:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mars will destroy all of your monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.41,0:15:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's not all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.75,0:15:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,For now it's Marek's turn to\Ndisappear into the shadows!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.83,0:15:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I must put an end to Marek's evil plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You will!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.73,0:15:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You make it sound so easy, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.75,0:15:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But he seems to get stronger\Nand more evil with each duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.99,0:15:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And I believe that the\Ndarker Merrick becomes,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.79,0:15:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,the harder it is to shield\Nthe world from his wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Merrick has begun to target my friends\Nbecause of a grudge he has against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.95,0:15:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be stopped before anyone\Nelse falls victim to his insanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.39,0:15:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to enter the\Ndarkness at the hands of Ra!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize that I am the darkness?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.63,0:15:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It means I can't be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.47,0:15:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't seen the last of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.65,0:16:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.47,0:16:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Part of me still exists within you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.69,0:16:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.43,0:16:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess a certain someone has\Nno use for this now, Beric?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how long have you been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.11,0:16:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you did with Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.83,0:16:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you mean the spirit\Nof the Millennium Ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,you tell me where one goes\Nafter losing a shadow game. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so surprised, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.03,0:16:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before you\Njoin him in the Shadow Realm!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.85,0:16:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu, help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishizu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.09,0:17:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.15,0:17:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, sister? It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,your brother you are merrick can it
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,be it is and i need your help i told
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.49,0:17:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,that fool i couldn't be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.87,0:17:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,part of me has been hiding inside\Nthe millennium puzzle all along
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.51,0:17:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,From this one piece of\Nthe Millennium Puzzle,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.25,0:17:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall explore the item's power\Nand one day claim it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.89,0:17:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring, transfer a portion of my\Nspirit into this piece of the puzzle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.79,0:17:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Marek may think I'm out of his way,\Nbut as I told him, I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, there's work to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.99,0:17:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And where better to\Nunlock the power of the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:18:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh than in the dwelling\Nof the Pharaoh himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have done this long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the Shadow Realm, Odeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A Shizu must be behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.35,0:18:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Very interesting indeed. It\Nseems that certain secret
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.01,0:18:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,abilities were added to the\Nwinged dragon of Ra When
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.29,0:18:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,that Egyptian god card was\Ncreated I must possess it if
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.33,0:18:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I am to regain my glory as\Nthe world's greatest duelist
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.27,0:18:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, what are you doing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Even you need some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another round of finals tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of that, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.11,0:18:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly what I'm preparing for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.31,0:18:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,We're currently on course\Nfor Kaiba Corp Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.37,0:19:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where the finals will end,\Nand the champion will be crowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.73,0:19:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fitting place for my\Nvictory, and soon we will arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,At the very site where our\Nstepfather was last seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,After I took over the corporation\Nand left him with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.37,0:19:18.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The tower I built, symbolizing\Nthe new era of Kaiba Corp,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.63,0:19:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,still stands as a reminder of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.65,0:19:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.56,0:19:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,now do you understand why I've chosen this\Nisland for the conclusion of the finals?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.67,0:19:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm finally ready to return to the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.83,0:19:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,land where our stepfather\Nmade his billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.43,0:19:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I too have built a mighty empire,\Nand I've done it all on my own terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.43,0:19:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's just how I'll\Nwin this tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With no help from anyone\Nexcept for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long now, Mokuba,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.89,0:19:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,before I prove to the entire world that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.03,0:19:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,there is no one on Earth\Nwho's superior to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Dookyo, you're the king of the king.
